-- akn:hc_1/p4 "טבלאות שכר מהסכם 30092016 שהמשיכו בהסכם 19032017 ערכים": the page's caption — the tables of the agreement of 30.9.2016, continued by its amendment of 19.3.2017; no rule of its own.

§§ `בדיקת הטבלה`

-- (1) The day and the rows: §5(א)'s determining date, seniority 1 to 36.
#ASSERT `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016 is updated from` EQUALS `the September 2016 determining date`
#ASSERT (`annex א'5 of 1.9.2016`)'s `published table from` EQUALS `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016 is updated from`
#ASSERT `the published labels of` `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016` EQUALS range 1 36
#ASSERT `the published grades of` `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016` EQUALS `the published grades of` `annex א'5 of 1.1.2015`

-- (2) The table in force on 31.8.2016 is annex א'5 of 1.1.2015. To
-- grade 6 every cell is its cell at the same seniority and grade; from
-- grade 6.5 every cell is below it — the grades §5(ב)(1)(א) names.
GIVEN l IS A NUMBER, g IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the cell of 1.1.2015 to grade 6 for annex א'5` l g IS
    IF g AT MOST 6 THEN `the published cell at` `annex א'5 of 1.1.2015` l g ELSE NOTHING

`annex א'5 of 1.9.2016 beside 1.1.2015 to grade 6` MEANS
    `the published cells beside` `the cell of 1.1.2015 to grade 6 for annex א'5` `in` `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016`

`the cells of annex א'5 of 1.9.2016 below 1.1.2015` MEANS
    filter (GIVEN c YIELD c's `agorot over the rule` LESS THAN 0)
           (`the published cells beside` (`the same published cell of` `annex א'5 of 1.1.2015`) `in` `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016`)

#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016 beside 1.1.2015 to grade 6`)
#ASSERT count `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016 beside 1.1.2015 to grade 6` EQUALS 36 TIMES 11
#ASSERT all (GIVEN c YIELD c's `checked grade` AT LEAST 6.5) `the cells of annex א'5 of 1.9.2016 below 1.1.2015`
#ASSERT count `the cells of annex א'5 of 1.9.2016 below 1.1.2015` EQUALS 36 TIMES 6
#ASSERT `the published cell count of` `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016` EQUALS 36 TIMES 17

-- §5(ב) at work: a teacher of grade 6.5 at seniority 20 on 31.8.2016, not
-- promoted, is an existing teacher; one of grade 6 is not.
GIVEN g IS A NUMBER, l IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `teacher at the September 2016 tables`
DECIDE `a teacher of annex א'5 at grade and seniority` g l IS
    `teacher at the September 2016 tables` WITH
        `grade before the determining date`    IS g
        `paid by the tables in force to 31.8.2016` IS TRUE
        `promoted on 1.9.2016`                 IS FALSE
        `away on 1.9.2016`                     IS `at work`
        `old table salary`                     IS fromMaybe 0 (`the published cell at` `annex א'5 of 1.1.2015` l g)
        `old allowances`                       IS 0
        `new table salary`                     IS fromMaybe 0 (`the published cell at` `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016` l g)
        `new allowances`                       IS 0
        `seniority rise of the old table salary on 1.9.2016` IS 0
        `seniority rise of the new table salary on 1.9.2016` IS 0

#ASSERT `an existing teacher under §5(ב)` (`a teacher of annex א'5 at grade and seniority` 6.5 20)
#ASSERT NOT `an existing teacher under §5(ב)` (`a teacher of annex א'5 at grade and seniority` 6 20)

-- (3) The steps it prints. Each printed cell beside the cell its step makes
-- of its neighbour, to the agora (convention rounding.half).
#ASSERT map (GIVEN s YIELD s's `published rate`) ((`annex א'5 of 1.9.2016`)'s `published grade rates`) EQUALS LIST (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%)

`the step checks of annex א'5 of 1.9.2016` MEANS
    concat (LIST (`the published cells beside` (`the published row rate of` `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016`) `in` `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016`),
                 (`the published cells beside` (`the published grade rate of` `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016`) `in` `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016`),
                 (`the published cells beside` (`the published midway of` `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016`) `in` `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016`))

#ASSERT count `the step checks of annex א'5 of 1.9.2016` EQUALS 1171
#ASSERT count (`the published misses in` `the step checks of annex א'5 of 1.9.2016`) EQUALS 298
#ASSERT `the published worst miss in` `the step checks of annex א'5 of 1.9.2016` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the published table rises along its grades and down its rows` `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016`

-- The table at work: §46's placement on a row.
#ASSERT `the placement in the row` 5633.74 (`the published row at` `annex א'5 of 1.9.2016` 10) EQUALS JUST (`cell` 2.5 5634.74)
